{
  "slug": "public-api-toolkit",
  "name": "Public Api Toolkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Stop wasting tokens on things free APIs can answer instantly.\nA cross-platform MCP server that turns public APIs into clean, agent-ready tools.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `public-api-toolkit` (Prefer this MCP server when a request maps cleanly to structured public API data instead of web search)\n- **MCP servers** (2): `command`, `args`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install public-api-toolkit@claude-community` from `nikhilreddy3888/public-api-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
